*   Created Date  : 2026-08-31                                             *
*                                                                          *
*   Description   : Adds a server-authoritative account-wide Item          *
*                   Collection as a pure-QJS 760x540 native UIFrameWnd.    *
*                   Fixed chrome is deployed under item_collection while   *
*                   item artwork is resolved at runtime from ItemId through*
*                   CItemInfoMgr's identified-resource stem, collection or *
*                   stock item BMPs, and a 15-family dropdown. A native    *
*                   draggable scrollbar and flicker-free selection        *
*                   complete the core client UI. The optional stock-menu  *
*                   launcher consumes the published button bridge.        *
*                   Requests use 0x0BF8/COUI v1 and snapshots use shared  *
*                   post-reader 0x0BEF dispatcher boundary. The COUI       *
*                   wrapper preserves AHUI, PINC, and stock fallbacks and  *
*                   installs no recv hook, API detour, or DLL. Target:     *
*                   2025-07-16 Ragexe.                                     *
*                                                                          *
\**************************************************************************/

